SUMMARY:Language Social Event @ Lobster Burger Bar - King West by TorontoB
 abel
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\n🌍
 ✨ **Wednesday Social @ Lobster Burger Bar – King West!**\n\nToronto Ba
 bel is taking over King West! 🎉 We're bringing our language exchange an
 d social night to a NEW location for 1 night only near St. Andrew Station.
  Join us for an exciting evening of international connections\, music\, gr
 eat food\, cocktails\, and drinks! 🌎💬\n\nWhether you're practicing J
 apanese\, French\, Korean\, Spanish\, English\, etc.\, or simply looking t
 o make new friends and enjoy a fun night out in the city\, everyone is wel
 come!\n\n✨ **What to Expect:**\n✅ Language Exchange 🇫🇷🇯🇵
 🇲🇽🇩🇪🇰🇷\n✅ Make New Friends & International Connections
  🌎\n🍹 Cocktails\, Drinks & Social Vibes 🍸\n🍔 Delicious Food & 
 Appetizers\n💬 Great Conversations & Networking\n\n📍 **Lobster Burger
  Bar – King West**\n214 King St W Ste 100\, Toronto\, ON M5H 1K4\n🗓
 ️ Wednesday\, November 11\n🕖 7:00 PM – 11:00 PM\n\n🍹 **Happy Hou
 r After 8 PM!** Grab a bite\, enjoy some drinks\, and take advantage of th
 e food and drink specials while mingling with the Toronto Babel crew!\n\nP
 ull up solo or bring a friend—either way\, you'll leave with new connect
 ions\, good laughs\, and even better vibes 💬🫶🌟\n\n💵 **$5 Entry
  Donation**\nYour contribution helps cover Meetup costs\, name tags\, and 
 all the little extras that make our events special ✨\n\n📲 **E-transfe
 r also available:**\n[tmg8@wealthsimple.me](mailto:tmg8@wealthsimple.me)\n
 \n🔗 **Meetup:**\n[http://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel](http://www.meetup
 .com/TorontoBabel)\n\n📘 **Facebook:**\n[https://www.facebook.com/groups
 /torontobabel](https://www.facebook.com/groups/torontobabel)\n\n💬 **Wha
 tsApp:**\n[https://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7](https://chat.
 whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7)\n\n📸 **Instagram:**\n[https://www.
 instagram.com/t.o.babel](https://www.instagram.com/t.o.babel)\n\n👉 **Ch
 eck out the calendar & RSVP:**\n[http://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calen
 dar](http://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calendar)\n\n📝 **Note:** Toron
 to Babel is a welcoming and safe space for all attendees. Any form of hara
 ssment or inappropriate behavior will not be tolerated. If you experience 
 or witness any issues\, please inform one of the organizers immediately so
  we can address it appropriately.\n#Toronto #TorontoEvents #KingWest #Lang
 uageExchange #MeetNewPeople #TodoToronto
